# TinyRoute stack (locked)

When designing or writing LLD, APIs, classes, or implementation for this repo:

- Backend is **Spring Boot** (Java). Controllers, services, filters, JPA, Redis adapters.
- Frontend is **Next.js**. HTTP client only; no ownership or redirect policy in the UI.
- PostgreSQL is the system of record. Redis is refresh sessions, JWT revocation, redirect cache, and rate limits.

